{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14452","headline":"赠行脚僧 · 戴叔伦","name":"赠行脚僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"补衲随缘住，难违尘外踪。\n木杯能渡水，铁鉢肯降龙。\n到处栖云榻，何年卧雪峰。\n知师归日近，应偃旧房松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}